```

AWS/PostgreSQL target example:
```bash
export REQ001_TEST_DATABASE_URL='postgresql://<user>:<password>@<host>:5432/<db>'
export PGSSLMODE='require'
```

## Local Development Mode
Local mode uses the production-intended PostgreSQL schema against a workstation-accessible database.

Recommended flow:
```bash
cd runs/kit/REQ-001
node --test test/tests/unit/domain/*.test.js
bash test/tests/integration/db/migration_smoke_test.sh
