## Assumptions
- PostgreSQL supports `pgcrypto` for UUID generation in both local and AWS-targeted environments.
- Migration validation runs against an isolated disposable database because the test scripts reset the `public` schema.
- Later REQs will reuse these canonical contracts rather than redefining lifecycle or table semantics.
